{"sha": "df54d79c99e1a96c0b2369bd45cdee4db5dd6bc950c17917ad028baba8b2ebd8", "body": ["\\begin{method}[保留几位数字]\\label{met:g10:orders-of-magnitude:sigfig}", "计算结果的精度不能高于其原始数据的精度。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在乘积或商中，保留的有效数字位数应", "        与\\emph{精度最低}的因子保持相同。", "  \\item 只对最终结果取整，中间步骤不取整。", "  \\item 拿不准时，三位有效数字即为本书的", "        工作精度。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[地球的周长]\\label{ex:g10:orders-of-magnitude:sigfig}", "地球的直径为 $d = \\qty{1.27e7}{m}$（三位有效数字），", "因此其周长为", "$\\pi d = \\num{3.14159} \\times \\qty{1.27e7}{m} = \\qty{3.99e7}{m}$ ---", "三位有效数字，而非计算器显示的八位。写成", "$\\qty{39898227}{m}$ 则等于声称能将这颗行星精确到米。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.9cm, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.3,0) -- (5.45,0);", "  \\foreach \\e in {0,...,5} {", "    \\draw (\\e,-0.1) -- (\\e,0.1);", "    \\node[below] at (\\e,-0.12) {$10^{\\e}$};", "  }", "  \\foreach \\x in {2.301,2.477,2.602,2.699,2.778,2.845,2.903,2.954}", "    \\draw (\\x,-0.05) -- (\\x,0.05);", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omMeth] (0,0.45) -- (1,0.45)", "    node[midway, above] {$\\times 10$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (2.477,0) circle (1.7pt);", "  \\node[above=3pt, omDef] at (2.477,0.06) {$3 \\times 10^{2}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, dashed] (2.38,0.22) -- (2.06,0.22);", "  \\fill[omThm] (3.845,0) circle (1.7pt);", "  \\node[above=3pt, omThm] at (3.845,0.06) {$7 \\times 10^{3}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, dashed] (3.90,0.22) -- (3.96,0.22);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 刻度尺上每一等距的刻度都\\emph{乘以}十。小刻线为", "$200, 300, \\dots, 900$：每段内挤满了整整一个十倍的范围。", "在此刻度尺上 $\\num{300}$ 靠近 $10^{2}$，而", "$\\num{7000}$ 靠近 $10^{4}$ --- 即它们的数量级。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{宇宙的阶梯}", "", "\\begin{definition}[数量级]\\label{def:g10:orders-of-magnitude:oom}", "称某一量的\\emph{数量级}\\index{数量级}", "为与其最接近的十的幂：将该量写成", " $a \\times 10^{n}$，其中 $1 \\leq a < 10$，取 $10^{n}$，当 $a < 5$ 时，", "$10^{n+1}$，当 $a \\geq 5$ 时。（分界处的确切约定", "从不影响结论：数量级的表述只在", "十倍之内有意义。）", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[数量级举例]\\label{ex:g10:orders-of-magnitude:oom}", "人的一生约持续 $80$ 年，即\\", "$80 \\times \\qty{3.16e7}{s} \\approx \\qty{2.5e9}{s}$：数量级为", "$\\qty{e9}{s}$ --- 约数十亿秒，要好好利用。人的", "身高为 $\\qty{1.7}{m}$，数量级为 $\\qty{e0}{m}$。珠穆朗玛峰，", "$\\qty{8848}{m}$：数量级为 $\\qty{e4}{m}$，因为 $8.848 \\geq 5$。", "\\end{example}", "", "将这些估算按指数排列，便得到本章的总图", "景：一座阶梯，每一级都是", "比下一级宽十倍的世界。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.26cm, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-16.5,0) -- (28.7,0);", "  \\foreach \\e in {-15,-10,-5,0,5,10,15,20,25} {", "    \\draw (\\e,-0.12) -- (\\e,0.12);", "    \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\e,-0.14) {$10^{\\e}$};", "  }", "  \\foreach \\e/\\t in {-15/nucleus, -10/atom, -6/bacterium, 0/human,", "                     7/Earth, 11/Earth--Sun, 16/light-year,", "                     21/Milky Way, 27/universe} {", "    \\draw[omDef, thick] (\\e,0.14) -- (\\e,0.62);", "    \\node[rotate=52, anchor=south west, inner sep=1pt, omDef]", "      at (\\e,0.66) {\\t};", "  }", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (26.6,-0.75) {尺寸（\\unit{m}）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 宇宙的阶梯，以米为单位：$42$ 个十的幂", "将原子核与可观测宇宙隔开，而人类", "位于距原子十级、距顶端二十七级之处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "在地球这一级之上，米已不便于使用，天文学", "保留了自己的单位，两者皆由这座阶梯本身定义。", "", "\\begin{definition}[天文单位与光年]\\label{def:g10:orders-of-magnitude:lightyear}", "称\\emph{天文单位}\\index{天文单位}", "（$\\qty{1}{au} = \\qty{1.496e11}{m}$）为地球与太阳之间的平均", "距离。称\\emph{光年}\\index{光年}（\\unit{ly}）为", "光在一年中所传播的距离。光在真空中以", "\\[", "c = \\qty{3.00e8}{m/s},", "\\]", "即自然界允许的最快速率 --- 因此光年是一个距离，", "而不是时间。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1.08cm, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (7.6,0) -- (17.5,0);", "  \\foreach \\e in {8,10,12,14,16} {", "    \\draw (\\e,-0.12) -- (\\e,0.12);", "    \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\e,-0.14) {$10^{\\e}$};", "  }", "  \\foreach \\x/\\t/\\d/\\a in {8.58/Moon/{\\qty{1.3}{s}}/north,", "                           11.17/Sun/{\\qty{8.3}{min}}/north,", "                           12.65/Neptune/{\\qty{4.2}{h}}/north,", "                           15.98/{$\\qty{1}{ly}$}/{\\qty{1}{yr}}/north east,", "                           16.60/Proxima/{\\qty{4.2}{yr}}/north west} {", "    \\draw[omDef, thick] (\\x,0.14) -- (\\x,0.55);", "    \\node[rotate=52, anchor=south west, inner sep=1pt, omDef]", "      at (\\x,0.58) {\\t};", "    \\node[anchor=\\a, font=\\footnotesize, omThm] at (\\x,-0.55) {\\d};", "  }", "  \\node[right, font=\\footnotesize] at (17.5,0) {距离（\\unit{m}）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}